      "text": "U kamen najde starou jazzovou desku a nechá teplou, praskající hudbu naplnit kouty místnosti. \n\n Teplo kuchyně a měkká, houpavá melodie ji ukolébají do hlubokého, oceánského pocitu klidu. Práce může počkat do zítřka. Dnešní noc je určena k odpočinku.", 
      "choice1": "Jít spát", 
    } 
  }, 

  115: { 
    "image": "assets/images/porch_night.jpg", 
    "sfx": "porch_night.mp3", 
    "nextIndex1": 116, 
    "en": { 
      "text": "She sits on the porch steps, watching the fireflies perform a silent, blinking dance in the tall grass. The darkness here isn't something to be feared. It is a soft, velvet blanket that covers the world in kindness. \n\n She sits in the dark, listening to the valley breathe in a slow, steady rhythm until her own eyelids grow heavy with a healthy, natural tiredness.", 
      "choice1": "Go to bed", 
