      "text": "In the upstairs loft, the bed smells of sun-dried linen and mountain wind. As Elara drifts off into a dreamless sleep, the last thing she hears is the silver rustle of the wind in the olive trees. \n\n Tomorrow is a brand-new day in the Valley of Gold. And for the first time in years, she is ready for it.", 
